TEXT -120 64 Left 2 ;--- INPUT ---
TEXT 576 64 Left 2 ;--- POWER STAGE ---
TEXT 1536 64 Left 2 ;--- PWM MODULATOR ---
TEXT -568 496 Left 2 ;--- ARM DAC REFERENCE (DVFS) ---
TEXT 576 528 Left 2 ;--- TYPE III COMPENSATOR ---
TEXT 1536 528 Left 2 ;--- ERROR AMPLIFIER ---
TEXT 96 880 Left 2 !.tran 0 2.4m 0 10n
TEXT 96 920 Left 2 !.ic V(VOUT)=0
TEXT 96 960 Left 2 !.options plotwinsize=0 reltol=2e-3
TEXT 96 1024 Left 2 ;ADAPTIVE BUCK CONVERTER - ARM-CONTROLLED DVFS
TEXT 96 1056 Left 2 ;Vin 5V (steps to 4V at 1.7ms) -> Vout programmable 1.8 / 1.2 / 0.9 V,  fsw = 500 kHz
TEXT 96 1120 Left 2 ;VDAC = MCU DAC word. RSL/CSL = 4.7us reference slew filter (bounds inrush on a DVFS step).
TEXT 96 1152 Left 2 ;VSAW x V(VIN) inside BPWM = input-voltage feed-forward: modulator gain Vin/Vramp = 1 exactly.
TEXT 96 1184 Left 2 ;-> loop gain independent of Vin, AND zero velocity error while the reference is ramping.
TEXT 96 1216 Left 2 ;BSW+VSNS+L1 = ideal synchronous half-bridge (Rser 37m = FET Rds(on) + inductor DCR).
TEXT 96 1248 Left 2 ;BIIN reflects inductor current back to the input so Iin and efficiency are real.
TEXT 96 1280 Left 2 ;R1/R3/C3/CC/RC/CP = Type III network around BEA. fz 4.8/4.9k, fp 88k/234k.
TEXT 96 1312 Left 2 ;Unity feedback (no divider): VOUT is regulated straight to VREF, so the loop is
TEXT 96 1344 Left 2 ;identical at every DVFS setpoint. fc = 47 kHz, phase margin 72 deg.
TEXT 96 1408 Left 2 ;Probe: V(VOUT) vs V(VREF), V(SW), V(COMP) vs V(SAW)*V(VIN), I(VSNS), I(VIN).
